flowchart LR
    subgraph Trusted[Trusted control plane]
        Policy[System policies]
        UserAction[Explicit user action]
        Validator[Schema / domain / permission validator]
        Executor[Zotero / Git / file executor]
    end

    subgraph Untrusted[Untrusted data plane]
        PDF[PDF text and embedded content]
        Metadata[External metadata and citation contexts]
        Repo[Imported Git / Markdown content]
        Model[Model output]
    end

    PDF --> Prompt[Prompt context builder]
    Metadata --> Prompt
    Repo --> Prompt
    Policy --> Prompt
    UserAction --> Prompt
    Prompt --> Model
    Model --> Proposal[Structured proposed objects/actions]
    Proposal --> Validator
    Policy --> Validator
    UserAction --> Validator
    Validator -->|valid note draft| Review[Human Review Queue]
    Validator -->|approved external action| Executor
    Review -->|accept / edit| Knowledge[(Verified Local Knowledge)]
    Review -->|reject| Discard[Rejected / audit only]
